{
  "category": "Hypnosis Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Puts enemies to sleep then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating bad dreams.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Puts enemies to sleep then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating bad dreams.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you sleep by it all the time, it will sometimes show you dreams it has eaten in the past.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you think that you had a good dream, but you can't remember it, a DROWZEE has probably eaten it.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It remembers every dream it eats. It rarely eats the dreams of adults because children's are much tastier.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it twitches its nose, it can tell where someone is sleeping and what that person is dreaming about.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that one of these POKéMON is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that one of these POKéMON is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that a DROWZEE is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "A descendent of the legendary animal baku, which is said to eat dreams. It is skilled at hypnotism.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Puts enemies to sleep, then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating only bad dreams.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
